  "q8_inclusion_justification": {
    "justification": "Although this is human microarray data with a case/control design, the study investigates coronary artery disease using peripheral blood samples rather than ALS-FTD or relevant CNS tissues. It therefore fails the disease-target and CNS-tissue inclusion criteria."
